  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.89222717285156,
        503.2632141113281,
        85.3282241821289
      ],
      "text": "2.1.2 Moderate complexity automated NAATs for detection of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        85.69221496582031,
        345.42010498046875,
        102.12821197509766
      ],
      "text": "and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        112.36524200439453,
        526.9700317382812,
        125.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "Rapid detection of TB and rifampicin resistance is increasingly available as new technologies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        127.86524200439453,
        526.9653930664062,
        141.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "are developed and adopted by countries. However, what has also emerged is the relatively high",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9606294631958,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.365234375,
        526.6071166992188,
        156.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "burden of isoniazid-resistant, rifampicin-susceptible TB that is often undiagnosed. Globally,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        158.865234375,
        526.5172729492188,
        172.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid-resistant, rifampicin-susceptible TB is estimated to occur in 13.1% (95% CI: 9.9–16.9%)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.948429107666016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        174.365234375,
        442.6051940917969,
        187.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "of new cases and 17.4% (95% CI: 0.5–54.0%) of previously treated cases ( ). 1",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        198.36907958984375,
        526.8724365234375,
        211.5140838623047
      ],
      "text": "A new class of technologies has come to market with the potential to address this gap. Several",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992597579956055,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.86907958984375,
        526.9008178710938,
        227.0140838623047
      ],
      "text": "manufacturers have developed moderate complexity automated NAATs for detection of TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.948982238769531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.36907958984375,
        527.3477172851562,
        242.5140838623047
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid on high throughput platforms for use in laboratories. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973367691040039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.86907958984375,
        524.41259765625,
        258.01409912109375
      ],
      "text": "tests belonging to this class are faster and less complex to perform than phenotypic culture-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.36907958984375,
        526.96240234375,
        273.51409912109375
      ],
      "text": "based drug susceptibility testing (DST) and line probe assays (LPA). They have the advantage",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.86907958984375,
        527.1461181640625,
        289.01409912109375
      ],
      "text": "of being largely automated following the sample preparation step. Moderate complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.36907958984375,
        527.0911865234375,
        304.51409912109375
      ],
      "text": "automated NAATs may be used as an initial test for detection of TB and resistance to both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.86907958984375,
        526.9644775390625,
        320.01409912109375
      ],
      "text": "first-line TB drugs simultaneously (rifampicin and isoniazid). They offer the potential for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.3691101074219,
        527.0999755859375,
        335.5141296386719
      ],
      "text": "rapid provision of accurate results (important to patients) and for testing efficiency where high",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982986450195312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.8691101074219,
        526.981201171875,
        351.0141296386719
      ],
      "text": "volumes of tests are required daily (important to programmes). Hence, these technologies are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3691101074219,
        464.792236328125,
        366.5141296386719
      ],
      "text": "suited to areas with a high population density and rapid sample referral systems.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.15533447265625,
        308.44207763671875,
        395.2433166503906
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.1.2.1 Class criteria for MC-aNAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
